><surname>Yang</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Dombkowski</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Hematopoietic stem cell quiescence maintained by p21<sup>cip1/waf1</sup>.</article-title><source>Science</source><volume>287</volume><fpage>1804</fpage><lpage>1808</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10710306</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000407-Kostic1"><label>8</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kostic</surname><given-names>I</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Roy</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><year>2003</year><article-title><italic>cki-1</italic> links cell division and cell fate acquisition in the <italic>C. elegans</italic> somatic gonad.</article-title><source>Dev Biol</source><volume>263</volume><fpage>242</fpage><lpage>252</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14597199</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000407-Fay1"><label>9</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fay</surname><given-names>DS</given-names></name><name><surname>Han</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Mutations in <italic>cye-1</italic>, a <italic>Caenorhabditis elegans</italic> cyclin E homolog, reveal coordination between cell-cycle control and vulval development.</article-title><source>Development</source><volume>127</volume><fpage>4049</fpage><lpage>4060</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10952902</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000407-Tilmann1"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tilmann</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Kimble</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Cyclin D regulation of